// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CalvinScott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P290545728" "Calvin Scott's Orders"
// DetailString :
"P2949209472" "Calvin Scott did not have any specific orders for you this time. He merely told you that it was time to return to the Resistance. Once all of this is done, you will be one of the Resistance members chosen to go through the Rift Enclosure into Primal Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - AntiMatterMoralChoice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P2916381120" "Invasion Plans"
// tDetailString :
"P1212338229" "This video contains the invasion plans that Emperor Cole has for Primal Earth. You kept it after Interrogator Kang helped you track down its location. The one part that strikes you each time is when the video mentions that there will be...<br><br><color gold>No Survivors</color><br><br>Interrogator Kang mentioned many times in your previous work with him that he was investigating a very large case.  This was it. You went to a lab to meet with him and discovered just exactly what Anti-Matter was working on all this time: a massive army for Cole to use to invade Primal Earth! It was here you were faced with a grim choice. Do you reveal this information to the people and risk riots and chaos breaking out in the streets of Praetoria, or do you bear this heavy burden on your own shoulders and see if you can stop Cole's plan for this massive war?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CalvinScott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1353588890" "{HeroName}, you've travelled quite the road, haven't you? I commend your efforts in infiltrating the Loyalists. But now, it's time for you to come home.<br><br>We have a new assignment for you."
// Answer Text :
"P1234334802" "I'll just have to finish up things with Kang. He has something important for me."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4222211890" "Understandable. I admit, I'm not too sure what Kang is going to want with you. But whatever it is, you need to <i>choose to come back to the Resistance</i>. Dr. Sheridan has completed a working <color yellow>Rift Enclosure</color> for us to use. You're going to travel to Primal Earth to help rally all of our allies there to help fight Emperor Cole.<br><br>Finish things up with Kang and Sheridan will contact you sometime afterwards.""
// Answer Text :
"P2875453231" "Will do, Scott."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2579643117" "<color orange>You access the computer and manage to use it to get in touch with Jessica Flores.</color><br><br>Hello? Hello? Who is this?"
// Answer Text :
"P317807569" "I'm {HeroName}. This is Jessica Flores, correct?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P4260841026" "Yes, this is she. {HeroName}? Aren't you, like, one of the big names in the Powers Division? Listen, if you're trying to arrest me for one of my reports...!"
// Answer Text :
"P2356805187" "I'm here to give you a report, Jessica. (Send the data through)"
// Page Page3 Text :
"P4258636091" "<color orange>There's silence on the line for a few minutes as Jessica watches the footage.</color><br><br>This... {HeroName}... this is... this is ground-breaking! If people knew about this, they wouldn't stand for it! Not if we make sure that Cole's propaganda machine doesn't spin it around!"
// Answer Text :
"P411048085" "So you'll get this out to the people?"
// Page Page4 Text :
"P961505670" "Yes, of course I will! It may take a while, well, it's <i>going</i> to take a while, but I'll make sure this gets in the right hands! I won't be able to just put it out on TPN. I've learned the hard way that Cole's machine knows how to spin things in his favor. But you can trust me, {HeroName}. I'll make sure that when this gets released, there's <i>no</i> way Cole can get out from this one!"
// Answer Text :
"P1035355044" "Alright, I'm trusting you with this, Jessica."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Kang 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P817270617" "{HeroName}, what is it?"
// Answer Text :
"P1874249999" "Kang, we can't let this out to the people."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1038112866" "What? {HeroName}, we <i>have</i> to, there is no choice in the matter! Cole isn't planning a war, he's planning a <i>slaughter</i>! How can you support that?! Innocents in Primal Earth will die, don't you understand?!<br><br>The people need to know, they need to stand against this!"
// Answer Text :
"P3783679016" "I understand, Kang. But this will only cause more innocents to suffer!"
// Page Page3 Text :
"P2144522864" "Then what do you suggest, {HeroName}? That we just sit by and let this happen? I've been here before the Seers, {HeroName}. I've seen how this country has changed. I <i>won't</i> stand by and let it be tarnished by something like this!"
// Answer Text :
"P669255334" "We handle it, Kang. You and I, we try to stop the invasion and keep the people safe."
// Page Page4 Text :
"P1351324290" "<color orange>Kang lets out a heavy sigh.</color><br><br>{HeroName}... I cannot help you. I can't keep secrets from people anymore. The Seers program, Arachnos, Longbow... I sacrificed my own <i>daughter</i> to <i>help</i> Praetoria! My own <i>daughter</i>, {HeroName}! I can't do it, anymore. I <i>can't</i> continue to support Cole, to support this government. And I can't let the people continue to think everything is fine when it is <i>not</i>!<br><br>I'm releasing this information to the people, {HeroName}. With or <i>without</i> your support."
// Answer Text :
"P3258084741" "Kang, don't make me do this. I'm trying to protect the people!"
// Page Page5 Text :
"P3716544719" "So am I, {HeroName}. You think you can save everyone from within the system, but you're wrong. It <i>can't</i> be done. I've tried, I've tried so hard to always do what's <i>right</i>, only to see people like Tilman and Berry put their own selfish needs ahead of the people.<br><br>I'm giving you one last chance, {HeroName}. Let me tell the people, or I'll force you out of my way."
// Answer Text :
"P1476177319" "I'm sorry, Kang. I can't let you do this."
// Page Final Text :
"P3598576158" "Then you leave me no choice!"
// Answer Text :
"P1944910011" "Kang...!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4186183897" "Well, {HeroName}, I believe you and I are done with each other. I've been ordered to cut ties with you in order to focus more on my current projects. Normally, I would just tell you to get out of my sight. But, I think you and I have an understanding of each other.<br><br>You want to protect the people of Praetoria, and I respect that. I want my creations to be perfect and long-lasting, unlike Berry's piles of junk.<br><br>I just have one last message that I received for you. I don't know <i>why</i> this PPD official thinks that I'm some sort of messenger boy. I'm sure that once I regain my Praetorship, none of this will happen again."
// AcceptString :
"P3575950544" "What's the message?"
// SendOffString :
"P2220837668" "It's from <color yellow>Interrogator Kang</color>. He wants you to meet him at this location. He said something about needing your help to finish one of his investigations.<br><br>Good luck with that, {HeroName}. When I rise back to power as a Praetor, you can be sure I won't forget the help you've given me today.<br><br><color Paragon>Resistance working undercover for Calvin Scott should call him now.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3145187515" "Meet with Kang (Single Player)"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2436911191" "<color orange>Anti-Matter turns away from you, talking to several people at once through the feed on his helmet.</color>"
// TaskTitle :
"P2735639391" "<color deepskyblue>No Survivors</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3152335745" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Responsibility</color>"

