"P2278530216" "Interrogator Kang"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1658698935" "{HeroName}, good to see you. Come here."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3940852711" "If you won't tell the people what they deserve to know, -I- will!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2932984833" "The people deserve to know the truth, {HeroName}! Even if it will cause suffering, they must know!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2621870547" "This city will not live blindly any longer, do you hear me?! The people must rise up and fight!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3965848794" "You can't save them, {HeroName}. You can't stop Cole, not like this!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3210611123" "{HeroName}...<em>I-if you're serious about this... p-please...<em>... A-at least... m-make sure that T-t-ilman...<em>p-pays for... f-for..."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P631796303" "There's a computer nearby, {HeroName}. Use it to get this information to a woman named Jessica Flores!"

