// 3 Resistance_Leader :
"P4136324224" "<t=4 d=4>I need to warn you, {HeroName}. You're not going to like what you see on this recording..."
// 7 Caption :
"P4195228790" "<t=5 x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>We've been ordered to mobilize by Emperor Cole. The target is confirmed: Primal Earth"
// 5 Caption :
"P469047767" "<t=5 x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>Each of the War Walkers can handle at least a dozen super-powered beings from Primal Earth."
// 5 Caption :
"P2912124392" "<t=5 x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>We've also designed them to disable the medi-porter technology on Primal Earth."
// 5 Caption :
"P3966677663" "<t=5 x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>Once the attack is launched, we predict the war will be over within a week."
// 7 Caption :
"P2236982717" "<t=5 x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>No super-powered being on Primal Earth will be left alive."
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P3450422529" "<em disagree t=4 d=4>We need to get this out to the people, {HeroName}. We can't allow this to happen!"
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P209200532" "<t=4 d=4>These people deserve a chance to reform, but Cole... he's going to kill every last super on Primal Earth!"
// LeftText :
"P123032128" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color Paragon>Reveal Cole's Invasion with Kang</color></scale><br>Reveal Cole's plans of war to the people</span><br><br><color Paragon>Aid the Resistance</color><br>The people of Praetoria need to know that their 'glorious' leader plans to launch a full scale war to <i>wipe out</i> an entire dimension of super beings!  What about the threat of Hamidon? Or using this army to secure peace in <i>this</i> world?<br><br>The people must know about this, to help rally against Cole and stop this war from happening! It will be difficult to gather support at first, but with this information known to everyone, it will be the first step of many towards rallying the people to the cause of the Resistance!<br><br><scale .8><color white><i>(This is the final moral choice for the Responsibility line in Praetoria.)</i></scale>"
// RightText :
"P3640672020" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color orange>Handle the Invasion Yourself</color></scale><br>Stop Cole's Invasion without the people knowing</span><br><br><color orange>Aid the Loyalists</color><br>Letting the people know about this could throw Praetoria into sheer chaos. There could be riots in the streets and more people than ever joining the Resistance. People <i>will</i> die if this is let out. But then again, innocents will die both in Praetoria and Primal Earth if this war goes through.<br><br>You'll have to prevent this news from getting out and then somehow find a way to stop this war yourself!<br><br><i><scale .8><color white>(This is the final moral choice for the Responsibility line in Praetoria.)</scale></i>"
